  "story": {
    "text": "Coming home, Mrs. Dashwood and Elinor find Marianne rushing out of the parlour in {TEARS}, apparently in violent {AFFLICTION}. Willoughby is leaving for London, at once, and for no {REASON} he will give. Marianne will not {EAT} or sleep; she {INDULGES} her grief, playing his {FAVOURITE} songs, and still no one knows if they are {ENGAGED}.",
